# trivy ignore list for rallish.
#
# Format: one CVE id per line (optionally `CVE-XXXX-YYYY exp:2026-12-31` to
# auto-expire). Keep this EMPTY by default — every entry is a deliberate,
# documented risk acceptance, not a convenience mute. The CI trivy job already
# sets `ignore-unfixed: true`, so CVEs with no available fix do not need an
# entry here; only add a fixed-but-accepted CVE with a reason + owner + date.
#
# Example (do not leave uncommented without a real justification):
# CVE-2025-00000  # accepted 2026-06-03 by <owner>: not reachable — <why>; revisit on dep bump
